{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-30","kind":"proposition","title":"把线段分成黄金比例","englishTitle":"To cut a given finite straight line in extreme and mean ratio.","book":6,"number":30,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.30","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.30/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":30,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","contentId":"euclid-6-30","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"42a0e73258285df59c5fd1097fdec8c7bb0d9973d28ef0c5c103c5cb66986fe5","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-30.statement","euclid-6-30.construction.1","euclid-6-30.proof.1","euclid-6-30.proof.2","euclid-6-30.proof.3","euclid-6-30.proof.4","euclid-6-30.proof.5","euclid-6-30.proof.6","euclid-6-30.proof.7","euclid-6-30.conclusion","euclid-6-30.historical.1","euclid-6-30.historical.2","euclid-6-30.historical.3","euclid-6-30.historical.4","euclid-6-30.historical.5","euclid-6-30.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-30.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a57698d10dd7f72bd3cfe9d03c80ad4d5ce5f83f39b4e8b53352dd1ee6da6d95","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To cut a given finite straight line in extreme and mean ratio."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"把给定线段分成两部分，使整条线段与较长部分之比，等于较长部分与较短部分之比。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线求作理分中末线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"把给定线段按中末比例分成两段，使整条线段与较长部分之比，等于较长部分与较短部分之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0b28d81d16e3945c03f6ef7e8458b7a8d0024388551f3d881617ec75b1a0bfb1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the given finite straight line; thus it is required to cut AB in extreme and mean ratio."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为给定的限定直线;因此,需要在黄金分割削减AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ff68412c60b54c9756b4205a36eda78bf073e099b3d77aa3152a90f033ee331","citations":["euclid-6-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"On AB let the square BC be described; and let there be applied to AC the parallelogram CD equal to BC and exceeding by the figure AD similar to BC. [[VI. 29](/principles/euclid-6-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB时,说明正方形 BC;对AC时,平行四边形 CD分等于BC分,超过AD分,与BC分类似。 [[VI. 29](/principles/euclid-6-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"651991b2740163030144df697663efbb38ce2455275a8053a507e7926e9060a3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now BC is a square; therefore AD is also a square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在BC是正方形,因此AD也是正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3eb857acf1ba30a1323bc9afec4b1d7607578519928e4cf4f075cb854e718b57","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BC is equal to CD, let CE be subtracted from each; therefore the remainder BF is equal to the remainder AD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC等于CD, 每人减去CE; 因此, 其余的 BF 等于 其余的 AD 。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"603300b7fe5a9707be3eeede6e4fdb06e667b56d427649917758cd999b76682c","citations":["euclid-6-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is also equiangular with it; therefore in BF, AD the sides about the equal angles are reciprocally proportional; [[VI. 14](/principles/euclid-6-14)] therefore, as FE is to ED, so is AE to EB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也具有等角;因此,在BF,AD中,关于平等角度的两面是对等的成比例;因此,FE对ED的比等于AE对EB的比；FE 与 ED 之比等于 AE 与 EB 之比。 [[VI. 14](/principles/euclid-6-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ae5708545d5649d56f6116cd82922901ba45dec29904484f26746a30ca4506d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But FE is equal to AB, and ED to AE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FE等于AB,ED至AE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"858838583fdc5b0a3ff486e7c5363cbf0888994b18e4ee5acdb1716ea9dbdd46","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as BA is to AE, so is AE to EB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BA对AE的比等于AE对EB的比；BA 与 AE 之比等于 AE 与 EB 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"57a5bdab169b332bfddb3a188eb54a50ebf0294640177613738eacf2da3208c4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AB is greater than AE; therefore AE is also greater than EB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB比AE强,AE也大于EB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d97c39b475d0f4f94cea2b532132eadba33a81a850c825eb29e390ec0bd64693","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the straight line AB has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at E, and the greater segment of it is AE. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,直线 AB在黄金分割的E时被削减,其较大的数量部分为AE,Q,E,F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e3ea4914fc725cd0bfcb74267186c71a6647a9e12b5a637f045531712028c8c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线求作理分中末线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"把给定线段按中末比例分成两段，使整条线段与较长部分之比，等于较长部分与较短部分之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c66e0888eeb49c87a73787e8a5f4c2ea90e29c80b699c9c411b71619a61328cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙线求理分中末先于元线作甲乙丙丁直角方形次依丁甲边作丁己带馀平行方形与甲丙直角方形等而甲己为其馀形又与甲丙形相似〈本篇廿九〉即甲己亦直角方形矣〈惟直角方〉〈形恒与直角方形相似〉则戊己线分甲乙于辛为理分中末线也〈本卷界说三〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘图方法如下：对于线条 :甲乙，首先在原点线之前绘制一个方形 甲乙丙丁，然后在 丁甲 和 甲丙 一侧用剩余平行四边形绘制一个平行四边形，而 甲己 是剩余的，并且类似于 甲丙。〈本篇廿九〉，即 甲己，也是一个方形。因此 〈惟直角方〉〈形恒与正方形相似〉 线 戊己 在 甲乙 处划分 辛，这也是合理划分的中间和最终线。〈本卷界说三〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a029b32ed301ffc5a9da82b5060ca7029f0279a4e9f021e7db88dceab7cf8df","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：丁己与甲丙两形既等每减一甲戊形即所存甲己辛丙两形亦等矣此两形之甲辛己戊辛乙两角既等〈两皆直角故〉即两角旁之各两边线为互相视之线也〈本篇十四〉而等戊辛之甲乙线与等辛己之甲辛线其为比例若甲辛与辛乙也是甲辛乙线为理分中末也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：丁己 和 甲丙 相等；对于每次减去 甲戊，保留的两个 甲己辛丙 形状也相等。这两个形状中 甲辛己戊辛乙 的两个角相等。〈两皆直角故〉 表示每个角旁的两条边线是相互看的线。〈本篇十四〉 和 戊辛 成比例。如果 甲辛 和 辛乙 也是 甲辛乙 线，这是合理划分的中间和后半部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6509001eb47ffda849ea97ce288920102a9bf33d08c5503494bbb8808590eb5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"又论曰：甲乙甲辛辛乙凡三线而第一第三矩内之辛丙直角形与第二甲辛上直角方形等即三线为连比例〈本篇十七〉而甲乙与甲辛若甲辛与辛乙矣"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"另一种证明如下：甲乙甲辛辛乙，对于所有三条线，第一个和第三个矩阵中的矩形 辛丙 与第二个 甲辛 上的正方形相等；也就是说，这三条线是延续比 〈本篇十七〉，而 甲乙 和 甲辛 与 甲辛 和 辛乙 相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4aa44ba96769c6dc8aeed3701f8f8390860dd70fe78e95819e8eed3173f9f9a0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"又法曰：甲乙线求分于丙而甲乙偕丙乙矩内直角形与甲丙上直角方形等〈二卷十一〉即甲乙之分于丙为理分中末线盖甲乙甲丙丙乙三线为连比例故〈本篇廿七〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"另一种作法：把线段甲乙分于丙，使甲乙与丙乙所作矩形的面积，等于以甲丙为边所作正方形的面积〈二卷十一〉。于是甲乙、甲丙、丙乙构成连比例〈本篇廿七〉，因此丙就是所求的中末比例分点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-30.source","contentId":"euclid-6-30","revisionId":"euclid-6-30@raw-42a0e73258285df5","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"339be58174e5288b0cd79d0ae8c67863277bb0f2f94b34dda3d0b8e29714963f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.30/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.30\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-30:euclid-6-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-30","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-30.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.30","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.30/","sourceLabel":"VI. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-30:euclid-6-14:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-30","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-30.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-14","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.30","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.30/","sourceLabel":"VI. 14"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-6-30:euclid-6-29:explicit","id":"euclid-6-29","book":6,"number":29,"kind":"proposition","title":"一直线求作依线之带馀平行方形与所设直线形等而其馀形与所设平行方形相似","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-6-30:euclid-6-14:explicit","id":"euclid-6-14","book":6,"number":14,"kind":"proposition","title":"两平行方形等一角又等即等角旁之两边为互相视之边两平行方形的一角等而等角旁两…","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-ratio","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
